<title>USA: Star Gas completes review, not to sell.</title>
<headline>Star Gas completes review, not to sell.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Star Gas Partners LP said Monday that it has completed its review of strategic alternatives and decided against seeking a sale at this time.</p>
<p>The company hired Stanley &amp; Co in August to expore a sale or merger with interested parties.</p>
<p>Star Gas shares were unchanged Friday at 23.</p>
<p>Petroleum Heat &amp; Power Co Inc has an interest in Star Gas.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
